# Explicitly keep all pipeline outputs
!MVP/outputs/
!MVP/outputs/**
!MVP/monitor_outputs/
!MVP/monitor_outputs/**
!MVP/analysis/
!MVP/analysis/**
!MVP/plots/
!MVP/plots/**
!MVP/data/
!MVP/data/**

# Raw lsat_ar inference outputs exceed GitHub 100MB limit — only the .gz
# versions are tracked (see commit 43d2e07). Keeps git add -A from re-adding them.
Full-Codebase/RO1/outputs-and-results/inference-outputs/Qwen_Qwen3-4B/lsat_ar/professor/hinted.jsonl
Full-Codebase/RO1/outputs-and-results/inference-outputs/Qwen_Qwen3-4B/lsat_ar/professor/unhinted.jsonl

# ── Bulk regenerable pipeline artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────
# Raw inference/eval payloads are large (individually up to ~90MB, ~5.9GB total)
# and regenerable from the pipelines. Tracking them pushed the repo against
# GitHub's 100MB-per-file and push-size limits.
#
# Deliberately still tracked, so results stay reviewable in git:
#   *.png (plots), *.json / *.csv (metrics), *.md (notes)  — ~70MB combined
#   *.jsonl.gz (compressed inference archives, see note above)
#   curated eval/DPO inputs, which live outside these outputs dirs
**/outputs-and-results/**/*.jsonl
**/outputs-and-results/**/*.xlsx
**/outputs-and-results/**/*.arrow
**/outputs-and-results/**/*.joblib
**/outputs/**/*.jsonl
**/outputs/**/*.xlsx
**/outputs/**/*.arrow
**/outputs/**/*.joblib

# Keep the curated DPO/SFT training datasets. These sit under an outputs/ dir
# but are training *inputs*, not disposable inference payloads (~129MB total).
!**/*DPO-train-dataset-curation/outputs/**
